# Proton Drive sync conflict copies. They must never be committed; delete them locally.
*Name clash*

# Raw device captures. Only the versions prepared for the README live in docs/images/,
# because a raw capture may still show account details the prepared one has masked.
Pictures for github/
# The raw screenshots, at whatever size the screen was. What ships is the scaled JPEG in
# docs/images; keeping both would put every picture in the repository twice.
Windows Pics/

# Operating systems and temporary files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
*~

# Eclipse-style output directories some IDEs create beside the Gradle ones. Build products, and
# they showed up as an untracked change on every status for weeks.
desktop/bin/
shared/bin/

# Staged release assets. Built artifacts, never committed.
release-*/
